B3Freq   "B3 freq"   0 10000 3656  freq 20 20000                                  | Band 3 frequency: centre, shelf midpoint or cutoff
B3Gain   "B3 gain"   0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Band 3 gain in 0.1 dB steps (bells and shelves)
B3Q      "B3 Q"      0 2000  807   exp 0.1 30 2                                   | Band 3 Q: bell and notch width, shelf and cut resonance (0.71 is flat)
B3Slope  "B3 slope"  0 2     0     enum 12_dB/oct 24_dB/oct 48_dB/oct            | Band 3 slope (low and high cut)
