B5Freq   "B5 freq"   0 10000 6250  freq 20 20000                                  | Band 5 frequency: centre, shelf midpoint or cutoff
B5Gain   "B5 gain"   0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Band 5 gain in 0.1 dB steps (bells and shelves)
B5Q      "B5 Q"      0 2000  807   exp 0.1 30 2                                   | Band 5 Q: bell and notch width, shelf and cut resonance (0.71 is flat)
B5Slope  "B5 slope"  0 2     0     enum 12_dB/oct 24_dB/oct 48_dB/oct            | Band 5 slope (low and high cut)
