B7Type   "B7 type"   0 5     2     enum Bell Low_shelf High_shelf Low_cut High_cut Notch | Band 7: bell, shelves (half the gain at the frequency), Butterworth cuts (−3 dB at the frequency with Q 0.71), notch
B7Freq   "B7 freq"   0 10000 8674  freq 20 20000                                  | Band 7 frequency: centre, shelf midpoint or cutoff
B7Gain   "B7 gain"   0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Band 7 gain in 0.1 dB steps (bells and shelves)
B7Q      "B7 Q"      0 2000  686   exp 0.1 30 2                                   | Band 7 Q: bell and notch width, shelf and cut resonance (0.71 is flat)
B7Slope  "B7 slope"  0 2     0     enum 12_dB/oct 24_dB/oct 48_dB/oct            | Band 7 slope (low and high cut)
group Band 8
B8On     "B8 on"     0 1     0     switch                                         | Band 8 in or out (an off band passes the signal untouched)
B8Type   "B8 type"   0 5     4     enum Bell Low_shelf High_shelf Low_cut High_cut Notch | Band 8: bell, shelves (half the gain at the frequency), Butterworth cuts (−3 dB at the frequency with Q 0.71), notch
B8Freq   "B8 freq"   0 10000 9847  freq 20 20000                                  | Band 8 frequency: centre, shelf midpoint or cutoff
B8Gain   "B8 gain"   0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Band 8 gain in 0.1 dB steps (bells and shelves)
B8Q      "B8 Q"      0 2000  686   exp 0.1 30 2                                   | Band 8 Q: bell and notch width, shelf and cut resonance (0.71 is flat)
B8Slope  "B8 slope"  0 2     0     enum 12_dB/oct 24_dB/oct 48_dB/oct            | Band 8 slope (low and high cut)
group Output
Output   "Output"     0 480   240   db -24 24                                      | Output gain in 0.1 dB steps
group Mode
Mode     "Mode"      0 1     0     enum Parametric Graphic                       | Parametric: the eight bands above. Graphic: 31 constant-Q bands at the ISO third-octave centres, 20 Hz – 20 kHz, set by the G sliders; the response passes through every slider (the bands' overlap compensated), and the parametric bands rest
group Graphic
