B3Attack  "B3 attack"    0 1000 639 time 0.00005 0.2 | Band 3 dynamic: time to 63 % of a gain change
B3Release "B3 release"   0 1000 532 time 0.005 3 | Band 3 dynamic: time back to 37 % of a gain change
B3Detect  "B3 detector"  0 1    0   enum Band Sidechain | Band 3 dynamic: Band: the detector hears the band's own input; Sidechain: the machine's second input (connect a machine to it), through the same shape and channel
